{
    "title": "DELITOON DE - Manga & Comics",
    "description": "The best app to read webtoons on your smartphone! Discover now our Delitoon series in scrolling manga format, 100% exclusive and always translated into German.\r\nRead the first episodes that are all about romance, strong heroines and humor for free and join our community. Warm welcome!\r\n\r\n## Mythical series\r\nLight and Shadow, The Black Dragon Lovers, Lucia, Off the Mask! , dr Elisa, the lady with the lamp... and much more! Find them all in our Delitoon app.\r\nLove, kpop, magic, fantasy... we are always one step ahead of manga :)\r\n\r\n## New episodes every day\r\nSomething to satisfy our manga fans' appetites! New episodes of your favorite series are released every day. You could say right away: Life in Delitoon is pretty busy!\r\n\r\n\r\n## Legal manga\r\nWe act with common sense and fairly. Authors, translators (Korean, Chinese, Japanese or French) are all paid, and that's perfectly normal. Of course we are not bandits!\r\n\r\n\r\n## Romance, but..!\r\nBeautiful sentimental love stories, that's exactly what we like here. Secret, forbidden, revealed love, we just never get enough of it!\r\nBut life isn't always about love! Make way for comedy, fantasy, sci-fi, period costume or impressive things like Boys Love!\r\nCheck back every day and discover our daily free offers\r\n\r\n\r\n## All series exclusive\r\nYou won't be able to find the Delitoon series anywhere else in German. We research and translate the best series that are currently trending.\r\nWe select the best writers who come from South Korea, Japan, China, etc.\r\nWe really study everything to make a good choice of manga: drawing, scenario and characters.\r\nDiscover the most popular novelties and series from authors with the craziest and newest ideas ... Only at Delitoon!\r\n\r\n## In bed, on the train, on the subway\r\n\r\nIt's really a great pleasure to read your manga on the smartphone with a suitable format for scrolling!\r\nDelitoon will be able to replace your \"ebook\" quickly, accompany you on the morning subway ride or even wait for the next lesson.",
